        INCREMENT self.rotation BY 90
        SET self.rotation TO (self.rotation MOD 360)
    END FUNCTION
END CLASS
```
**Key Functionality**: The `rotate` method adjusts the rotation property of the shape, ensuring it wraps around at 360 degrees.

---

3. |Case|:**position_shapes**
