FUNCTION load_shapes()
    OPEN 'shapes.txt' AS file
        FOR EACH line IN file
            SPLIT line INTO [type, position, rotation]
            PARSE position INTO tuple of integers
            PARSE rotation INTO integer
            CREATE Shape(type, position, rotation)
            APPEND shape TO self.shapes
        END FOR
    END OPEN
END FUNCTION
```
**Key Functionality**: The `load_shapes` function reads shapes from `shapes.txt`, creating shape objects and storing them in the `shapes` list.

